c_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-bz[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Day strip, redesigned — two calm lines under the daily note's plan [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]badges[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]On every canonical daily note that has a `bob-plan` block, the Day [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]strip renders directly under the plan badges, in Live Preview and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Reading view, as two calm, readable lines. The first line holds [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]five facts (`WORKED 5h 25m REVIEWED 64 DONE 30 CREATED 40 REVIEW [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]CLOSED not yet`). The second holds the area time mix plus `so far ·[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]HH:MM`. Nothing overlaps or overflows under real Obsidian styles, a[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]preview harness enforces that, and the CodeMirror end-of-note mount[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]is gone.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]day_strip_under_the_badges.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/day_strip_under_the_badges.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-bz[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-bz/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]New Day strip look — facts line, time-mix line, no buttons, [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]hostile-CSS preview[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-look[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-look: in bob-plugins' bob-ledger-tools, redesign the Day strip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]model, painter, and CSS into the two-line layout of the design contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Use LABEL-value facts, then a time-mix row with `so far · HH:MM`. Drop [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the history marks, the collapse chevron, and `Stats ↗`. Use no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`<button>` elements. Rebuild the preview matrix so it applies Obsidian's[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]baseline button and link rules, places the strip under mock plan badges,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and fails on overflow, overlap, a skeleton height mismatch, or a busted [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]budget. Rewrite the model and painter tests, then sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mount the strip under the bob-plan badges and delete the [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]end-of-note mount[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-home[dim] · [dim][/dim]after strip-look[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-home: in bob-plugins' bob-ledger-tools, host the Day strip inside [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the rendered `bob-plan` block of canonical daily notes, after the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]badges, in Live Preview and Reading view. The plan block's 5 s repaint [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]must never touch the strip host. Delete the CodeMirror StateField mount.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Rewire `Toggle Day stats`, `stats.day_strip`, and rollover to plan-block[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hosts. Replace the mount tests with plan-host tests, update the plugin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs and manifest, then sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Day strip contract in bob-cli docs, and notes on the open [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]memory beads[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after strip-home[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-docs: in bob-cli, rewrite the docs/stats.md \"Day strip\" section [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for the shipped placement and look: under the plan badges, two lines, no[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]history marks, no collapse, no fence stand-down. Check the dashboard and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON references. Then add notes to memory beads bob-cli-bs and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-bt saying their bottom-of-note, history-mark, and collapse [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]claims are superseded.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-bz","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","output_variables":{"artifacts":[{"bead":"bob-cli-bz.1","kind":"image","label":"Day strip preview 410-light (strip-look final)","path":"/home/bryan/.sase/artifacts/agents/gh_bobs-org__bob-cli/20261025074803/day-strip-410-light-5c96f01f85ab.png","ref":"file:explicit:2d117cff354bea79bb09c5f0","source_path":"/tmp/bob-day-strip-new/day-strip-410-light.png"},{"bead":"bob-cli-bz.1","kind":"image","label":"Day strip preview 410-dark (strip-look final)","path":"/home/bryan/.sase/artifacts/agents/gh_bobs-org__bob-cli/20261025074803/day-strip-410-dark-4926c42a2c17.png","ref":"file:explicit:cd075d163c52bd9b50e3c6c7","source_path":"/tmp/bob-day-strip-new/day-strip-410-dark.png"},{"bead":"bob-cli-bz.1","kind":"image","label":"Day strip preview 540-light (strip-look final)","path":"/home/bryan/.sase/artifacts/agents/gh_bobs-org__bob-cli/20261025074803/day-strip-540-light-a03850008fc2.png","ref":"file:explicit:4f1db5badbda4a18235f6422","source_path":"/tmp/bob-day-strip-new/day-strip-540-light.png"},{"bead":"bob-cli-bz.1","kind":"image","label":"Day strip preview 540-dark (strip-look final)","path":"/home/bryan/.sase/artifacts/agents/gh_bobs-org__bob-cli/20261025074803/day-strip-540-dark-361a6fe7b1cb.png","ref":"file:explicit:0b12378c25e4f0603aecb5ea","source_path":"/tmp/bob-day-strip-new/day-strip-540-dark.png"},{"bead":"bob-cli-bz.1","kind":"image","label":"Day strip preview 700-light (strip-loo